 "fp_wrestling_jakks-pacific_titan-tron-live_5_mankind_37858c": {
  "schema_version": "figure-claims-2",
  "figure_id": "fp_wrestling_jakks-pacific_titan-tron-live_5_mankind_37858c",
  "target": {
   "figure_id": "fp_wrestling_jakks-pacific_titan-tron-live_5_mankind_37858c",
   "character_canonical": "mankind",
   "character_variant": null,
   "manufacturer": "jakks-pacific",
   "product_line": "titan-tron-live",
   "release_wave": "5",
   "fandom": "wrestling",
   "year": null,
   "scale": "6in",
   "pack_size": "1",
   "v1_name": "Mankind"
  },
  "evidence": {
   "sources": [
    {
     "source_id": "s1",
     "url": "http://newplanetcybertron.blogspot.com/2013/03/misc-review-mankind-jakks-pacific-titan.html",
     "source_type": "forum",
     "fetch_status": "fetched",
     "retrieved_at": "2026-09-06"
    },
    {
     "source_id": "s2",
     "url": "https://wrestlingfiguredatabase.com/collections/jakks-pacific-wwf-wwe-titantron-live?page=5",
     "source_type": "collector_database",
     "fetch_status": "fetched",
     "retrieved_at": "2026-09-06"
    }
   ],
   "quotes": [
    {
     "quote_id": "q1",
     "source_id": "s1",
     "text": "The outfit that he wears, as a nod to his hardcore tradition, is custom faded with that classic torn and worn out look.",
     "scope": {
      "kind": "figure",
      "manufacturer": "jakks-pacific",
      "product_line": "titan-tron-live",
      "year": null,
      "character_canonical": "mankind",
      "character_variant": null,
      "condition": null
     }
    },
    {
     "quote_id": "q2",
     "source_id": "s1",
     "text": "He even has a necktie!",
     "scope": {
      "kind": "figure",
      "manufacturer": "jakks-pacific",
      "product_line": "titan-tron-live",
      "year": null,
      "character_canonical": "mankind",
      "character_variant": null,
      "condition": null
     }
    },
    {
     "quote_id": "q3",
     "source_id": "s1",
     "text": "The head sculpt is pretty darn good, and they got the hair and mask perfectly right.",
     "scope": {
      "kind": "figure",
      "manufacturer": "jakks-pacific",
      "product_line": "titan-tron-live",
      "year": null,
      "character_canonical": "mankind",
      "character_variant": null,
      "condition": null
     }
    },
    {
     "quote_id": "q4",
     "source_id": "s1",
     "text": "the head turns left and right limitedly – the shirt collar is clearly blocking Mankind's chin",
     "scope": {
      "kind": "figure",
      "manufacturer": "jakks-pacific",
      "product_line": "titan-tron-live",
      "year": null,
      "character_canonical": "mankind",
      "character_variant": null,
      "condition": null
     }
    },
    {
     "quote_id": "q5",
     "source_id": "s1",
     "text": "the shoulders are on some sort of a universal joints that allows all range of motions",
     "scope": {
      "kind": "figure",
      "manufacturer": "jakks-pacific",
      "product_line": "titan-tron-live",
      "year": null,
      "character_canonical": "mankind",
      "character_variant": null,
      "condition": null
     }
    },
    {
     "quote_id": "q6",
     "source_id": "s1",
     "text": "there are no elbows articulation, unfortunately, but he does come with rotating wrists.",
     "scope": {
      "kind": "figure",
      "manufacturer": "jakks-pacific",
      "product_line": "titan-tron-live",
      "year": null,
      "character_canonical": "mankind",
      "character_variant": null,
      "condition": null
     }
    },
    {
     "quote_id": "q7",
     "source_id": "s1",
     "text": "The legs move front and back at the hips; the knees bend into 90°",
     "scope": {
      "kind": "figure",
      "manufacturer": "jakks-pacific",
      "product_line": "titan-tron-live",
      "year": null,
      "character_canonical": "mankind",
      "character_variant": null,
      "condition": null
     }
    },
    {
     "quote_id": "q8",
     "source_id": "s1",
     "text": "This set only comes with one accessory, which is a worn out and bended pipe, made from bendable rubbery plastic.",
     "scope": {
      "kind": "figure",
      "manufacturer": "jakks-pacific",
      "product_line": "titan-tron-live",
      "year": null,
      "character_canonical": "mankind",
      "character_variant": null,
      "condition": null
     }
    },
    {
     "quote_id": "q9",
     "source_id": "s1",
     "text": "The pipe is as detailed as Mankind himself, custom-rusted with what appeared to be the galvanized coating peelings.",
     "scope": {
      "kind": "figure",
      "manufacturer": "jakks-pacific",
      "product_line": "titan-tron-live",
      "year": null,
      "character_canonical": "mankind",
      "character_variant": null,
      "condition": null
     }
    }
   ]
  },
